  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Alpha. LIBTMUX_SOCKET_NAME and LIBTMUX_SOCKET_PATH now point a connection that named no socket, so a harness, sandbox or container can move every unqualified connection at once without the call sites in between. Control mode no longer loses a reply when a command ends the client, and a chain refuses a target read from a server that has since restarted. Every documented example is executed against live tmux in CI rather than only compiled, and the blocks the documents publish come from that code. The public API is not settled and may change without notice between prereleases; pin an exact version. Full history: https://github.com/libtmux/libtmux-dotnet/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md",
